            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section ID="ID_6343bd76-f182-469c-b27d-b811a9a211bf">
               <id root="ef41b449-42ec-45cf-952c-adcb7710b5b9"/>
               <code code="44425-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="STORAGE AND HANDLING SECTION"/>
               <title>RECOMMENDED STORAGE:</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Store at 20°C to 25°C (68°F to 77°F); excursions permitted between 15°C to 30°C (59°F to 86°F) [See USP Controlled Room Temperature]. Brief exposure up to 40°C (104°F) does not adversely affect the product. Protect from freezing.  </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20181213"/>
            </section>
         </component>
